# Never commit data. This repository ships code and one model file — nothing
# else. Any readings, exports, or reference tables that land here by accident
# are ignored on purpose, because a single committed spreadsheet is not
# something a later commit can take back.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.parquet
*.db
*.sqlite*
data/
exports/
uploads/

